omp-advanced-claude-bridge
==========================

This project is an independently maintained fork of "omp-claude-bridge"
(https://github.com/DevVig/omp-claude-bridge), which is itself the Oh My Pi
(OMP) port of the original "pi-claude-bridge" extension.

