Upstream fork (Oh My Pi port)
-----------------------------
  omp-claude-bridge
  Copyright (c) 2026 Jonathan Borgwing
  https://github.com/DevVig/omp-claude-bridge
  Licensed under the MIT License.

  Changes from the original:
    - Ported the extension from Pi (@earendil-works/*) to Oh My Pi
      (@oh-my-pi/*), including the extension manifest, provider registration,
      message conversion, and config directory resolution.
    - Added a `provider.contextWindow` setting ("auto" | "1m" | "200k") and
      on-demand context-window variants in the model picker.

This fork
---------
  omp-advanced-claude-bridge
  Copyright (c) 2026 Thomas Übermeier
  https://github.com/its-a-unixsystem/omp-advanced-claude-bridge
  Licensed under the MIT License.

  Changes from omp-claude-bridge:
    - Ported the provider and AskClaude renderer to the Oh My Pi 19.2+
      extension API.
    - Rewrote the session and query core so each OMP provider session owns its
      own Claude Code session, history sync, and deferred steer replay,
      preventing subagents and side requests from sharing the main agent's state.
    - Hardened Claude Agent SDK error handling, abort checks, and signed
      thinking history import.

